lv , un tema cargado de actitud, picard\u251c\u00a1a y flow urbano pensado para el perreo sin pausa.\ \ \u00d4\u00c7\u00a3La Cone\u00d4\u00c7\u00d8 destaca por su energ\u251c\u00a1a directa y un ritmo pegajoso que combina un dembow s\u251c\u2502lido con una interpretaci\u251c\u2502n segura y provocativa. La canci\u251c\u2502n juega con la qu\u251c\u00a1mica entre dos personas que se desean sin filtros, manteniendo una vibra intensa y nocturna que encaja perfecto en la discoteca.\ \ Con frases atrevidas", "isVideo": false, "shortCode": "DVZC9_iE8g6", "timestamp": "2026-03-02T18:01:17.000Z", "displayUrl": "https://scontent-ord5-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/645432028_17948845578104367_5964013100992260136_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_fr_p1080x1080_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=103&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gENHnTasFTN_Eu44Hf8G19S7eQnVG5K5lw2GbRZTUZ5yQVjTuekl_cnL9_yNQuhAfU&_nc_ohc=PaTESqjEcA4Q7kNvwEvchq2&_nc_gid=0uAd8_odG06XQ3n71iIvHg&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_Afz0dq9TST_zgETsQQRSCZddKGAdtwUDsPS_phgi1rykZg&oe=69C907E3&_nc_sid=8b3546", "likesCount": 34, "commentsCount": 10, "videoViewCount": 189}, {"url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DVXewEdDLZx/", "type": "Video", "caption": "\u00ad\u00d8\u00f4\u00f6\u00ad\u00d8\u00f4\u00c1 \u00ad\u00d8\u00f4\u00a3\u00ad\u00d8\u00f4\u00a5\u00ad\u00d8\u00f4\u2557\u00ad\u00d8\u00f4\u00bc\u00ad\u00d8\u00f4\u2593\u251c\u00ae\u00ad\u00d8\u00f4\u00c1\u00ad\u00d8\u00f4\u00ac\u00ad\u00d8\u00f4\u2591\u00ad\u00d8\u00f4\u00a9 \u00ad\u0192\u00aa\u00e7 s\u251c\u2502lo sale de noche \u00ad\u0192\u00ff\u00ea yo tengo LA CONE yo tengo la v\u251c\u00a1a, yo te rompo to las aver\u251c\u00a1as, y te hago to lo que por Instagram t\u251c\u2551 me escrib\u251c\u00a1as \u00ad\u0192\u00c6\u00bc \ \ prod. @joofive & @j0tace_19 \u00ad\u0192\u00c4\u00f8\u00b4\u00a9\u00c5\ dise\u251c\u2592o: @el_rdos \u00ad\u0192\u00e6\u00bf\u00d4\u00c7\u00ec\u00ad\u0192\u00c4\u00bf", "isVideo": false, "shortCode": "DVXewEdDLZx", "timestamp": "2026-03-02T03:34:31.000Z", 