_n.webp?stp=dst-jpg_e15_fr_s1080x1080_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=107&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gHQBw_R69VOZ9exNV_ybCzTr2VXlnnWEJoXSy3K8eu1pmwsuyrhJk8q9pqOXalqKwM&_nc_ohc=Gtc5uCjC9YkQ7kNvwEtYiFB&_nc_gid=b1jelGWnGKinYECkUtjwCw&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&ig_cache_key=Mzc0NTYzNTg4ODYzNTIyOTg3OA%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&oh=00_Afynt5LoHGhQes-a2qFdyk54ztTx69BnWAeZU1cW5bQ0Eg&oe=69C92A98&_nc_sid=8b3546", "likesCount": 17, "commentsCount": 1, "videoViewCount": null}, {"url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DP6haIDDl-7/", "type": "Sidecar", "caption": "Un concierto de PRIMERA! \u00ad\u0192\u00bd\u2591\u00ad\u0192\u00c5\u2557\u00ad\u0192\u00ff\u00ec\ \ Desde una cancha de bolas criollas, varios ranchitos, bodega, licorer\u251c\u00a1a, una parada de autob\u251c\u2551s y una barber\u251c\u00a1a me encontr\u251c\u00ae en el \\"Barrio Ali Primera\\" que representa el origen y vida de la m\u251c\u2551sica.\ \ @servandoprimera & @florentinoprimera\ \ Ame todo el concepto y la esencia de este WORLD TOUR \\"Se buscas vivos o Inmortales\\" de @servandoyflorentino Que buscan dar una experiencia y reflejar de d\u251c\u2502nde viene la salsa \u00ad\u0192\u00ac\u00e7\u00ad\u0192\u00d1\u00fc\u00ad\u0192\u00c4\u2551 que surgi\u251c\u2502 en los barrios y no del escenario.\ \ #UnaFansEn", "isVideo": false, "shortCode": "DP6haIDDl-7", "timestamp": "2025-10-17T14:53:29.000Z", "displayUrl": "https://scontent-atl3-3.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/565182729_18534117802015555_4615996385289972911_n.webp?stp=dst-jpg_e15_fr_p1080x1080_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=107&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gHQBw_R69VOZ9exNV_ybCzTr2VXlnnWEJoXSy3K8eu1pmwsuyrhJk8q9pqOXalqKwM&_nc_ohc=D0pxN4DCg8sQ7kNvwEmg0C2&_nc_gid=b1jelGWnGKinYECkUtjwCw&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&ig_cache_key=Mzc0NTQ1Mjk1OTE2NjU0NDE3Mg%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&oh=00_AfxxHqpM8iid6yEsDZ6L6_7DS_uIjocVPnt6JtDKw2M5OA&oe=69C93809&_nc_sid=8b3546", "likesCount": 36, "commentsCount": 4, "videoViewCount": null}, {"url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DPWSl6zjnmD/", "typ