782050660_8761415278779440107_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_p1080x1080_sh0.08_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=100&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gE-bqcu8ogvi87tSZjE-C-hLe12Adk20J-D6f6-a3tinro0HJ31rRDssdCT0LNaxnk&_nc_ohc=_MdSKRo-EnoQ7kNvwEPKWm0&_nc_gid=7KxbxpAtQ452LZ5fu2-Ogg&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AfyPRYoqsJHUzxeergDioXSfuBOXmOv5sGsP5JnXkEfp-w&oe=69C9158B&_nc_sid=8b3546", "likesCount": 30, "commentsCount": 4, "videoViewCount": 200}, {"url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DCVNVOBNKj1/", "type": "Video", "caption": "\u00d4\u00d6\u00d1\u00b4\u00a9\u00c5\u00ad\u0192\u00c4\u00f4\u00d4\u00a3\u00bf", "isVideo": false, "shortCode": "DCVNVOBNKj1", "timestamp": "2024-11-14T00:19:44.000Z", "displayUrl": "https://scontent-atl3-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.2885-15/466819713_18475270306050660_926504692236436523_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=100&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gE-bqcu8ogvi87tSZjE-C-hLe12Adk20J-D6f6-a3tinro0HJ31rRDssdCT0LNaxnk&_nc_ohc=9C4IY9rGV8QQ7kNvwG-4J04&_nc_gid=7KxbxpAtQ452LZ5fu2-Ogg&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AfwNomNWrHkm-CCBqninNHjd0OyLEIMNszVmKq4YxGUUjA&oe=69C92040&_nc_sid=8b3546", "likesCount": 53, "commentsCount": 3, "videoViewCount": 255}, {"url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DCUjjGCvjU2/", "type": "Sidecar", "caption": "\u00ad\u0192\u00c4\u00f4\u00d4\u00d6\u00d1\u00b4\u00a9\u00c5\ \ Hoy despu\u251c\u00aes de cinco a\u251c\u2592os puedo decir \u252c\u00edlo lograste reina! \u00ad\u0192\u00e6\u00e6\u00ad\u0192\u00ff\u00ec\ el que me conoce sabe todo lo que mi alma anhelaba este d\u251c\u00a1a. \ \ Definitivamente en estos cinco a\u251c\u2592os, escrib\u251c\u00a1 una historia muy hermosa, llena de mucho esfuerzo, constancia, l\u251c\u00edgrimas, muchas l\u251c\u00edgrimas \u00ad\u0192\u00ff\u00e0 valent\u251c\u00a1a y sobre todo mucho amor \u00ad\u0192\u00d1\u2563\u00ad\u0192\u00c6\u00dc\ \ Hoy con mucho orgullo puedo decir que: \u252c\u00edSE LOGR\u251c\u00f4! \ \ No puedo estar m\u251c\u00eds orgullosa y feliz, todo te lo debo a ti papi\u00ad\u0192\u00ac\u00a2\u00d4\u00d6\u00d1\u00b4\u00a9\u00c5\ \ Gracias a Dios por permitirme gozar este d\u251c\u00a1a tan m\u251c\u00edgico \u00ad\u0192\u00d6\u00ee\u00ad\u0192\u00c5\u255d\ \u252c\u00edGracias por tanto ", "isVideo": false, "shortCode": "DCUjjGCvjU2", "timestamp": "2024-11-13T18:12:55.000Z", "displayUrl": "https://scontent-atl3-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/656479901_18187959406370789_2575936681798948958_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_p1080x1080_sh0.08_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=105&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gE-bqcu8ogvi87tSZjE-C-hLe12Adk20J-D6f6-a3tinro0HJ31rRDssdCT0LNaxnk&_nc_ohc=qcWQ-8wIiqEQ7kNvwEy7HoI&_nc_gid=7KxbxpAtQ452LZ5fu2-Ogg&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&ig_cache_key=MzUwMDU3OTE0NjA2MzIzNTk4NA%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&oh=00_AfzkyFvZlByfABm1RYFsPScZn1YjGow47kz8wS74LWIXBA&oe=69C92093&_nc_sid=8b3546", "likesCount": 148, "commentsCount": 34, "videoViewCount": null}, {"url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DB5QVmAtaHB/", "type": "Sidecar", "caption": "Fin del spam \u00ad\u0192\u00f1\u00ac\ Por ahora, falta un video \u00d4\u00ff\u2551\u00b4\u00a9\u00c5\u00ad\u0192\u00f4\u00ee\ \ 26.10 \ \ @alfredojrgil \ @ronald_ga1 \ @manuelisangulo21", "isVideo": false, "shortCode": "DB5QVmAtaHB", "timestamp": "2024-11-03T03:45:33.000Z", "displayUrl": "https://scontent-atl3-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/653520442_18065797340321690_7373304093396010571_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s1080x1080_sh0.08_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=102&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gE-bqcu8ogvi87tSZjE-C-hLe12Adk20J-D6f6-a3tinro0HJ31rRDssdCT0LNaxnk&_nc_ohc=Onzbc6iVAuAQ7kNvwHvcQqv&_nc_gid=7KxbxpAtQ452LZ5fu2-Ogg&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&ig_cache_key=MzQ5Mjg5NDgyOTk4NzcxNzE1OQ%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&oh=00_AfzUFnL8jk2AVO6iflJgdTshZXx3a9ZNkvhEwNH_YdqStA&oe=69C92E13&_nc_sid=8b3546", "likesCount": 23, "commentsCount": 0, "videoViewCount": null}, {"url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DB5Ovc9NHTG/", "type": "Sidecar", "caption": "26.10\u00ad\u0192\u00f4\u00ee", "isVideo": false, "shortCode": "DB5Ovc9NHTG