 dedicaci\u251c\u2502n que impones en tus sue\u251c\u2592os y metas. Vali\u251c\u2502 cada segundo \u00ad\u0192\u00c6\u00bd de esta etapa tan bonita que solo es el comienzo.\ \ Me siento orgullosa de mi, por cada esfuerzo y dedicaci\u251c\u2502n... en el que ahora pueda hacer lo que tanto me apasiona.\ \ Agradezco con mucho amor a todas las personas que me apoyaron y creyeron en mi\u00d4\u00d6\u00d1\u00b4\u00a9\u00c5\ \ .\ .\ .\ .\ \ \u00ad\u0192\u00c4\u00f4\u00ad\u0192\u00c6\u00bdGRADUADA \u00ad\u0192\u00c6\u00bd\u00ad\u0192\u00c4\u00f4\ \ #graduacion #tsu ##dise\u251c\u2592ografico #sue\u251c\u2592os #me", "isVideo": false, "shortCode": "DIIK7BwMM1G", "timestamp": "2025-04-07T01:55:13.000Z", "displayUrl": "https://scontent-ord5-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.29350-15/489034645_514376268223208_3937221896679254906_n.heic?stp=dst-jpg_e35_p1080x1080_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=108&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gEIRoiKZlRdmkmbQy1ixQyUE-T5zhX3yF9_1xWW3HD9Uzz0fNAfWOSn9hRTfiQBEEM&_nc_ohc=wLyxy1NkLLsQ7kNvwFHe3LW&_nc_gid=B1m6D_AQERgBrjDM8Shsvw&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&ig_cache_key=MzYwNTE3OTUyOTgzMjkzMDQzMg%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&oh=00_AfxLS7ZEEiWXk6fDWt-BKO5r4Ht0adzHxIQQxkh92-vUqA&oe=69C91EF9&_nc_sid=8b3546", "likesCount": 58, "commentsCount": 0, "videoViewCount": null}, {"url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C9U0nZtu12L/", "type": "Sidecar", "caption": "\u00ad\u0192\u00c6\u00f8\u00ad\u0192\u00ee\u2557\u00ad\u0192\u00f1\u00ec", "isVideo": false, "shortCode": "C9U0nZtu12L", "timestamp": "2024-07-12T14:05:05.000Z", "displayUrl": "https://scontent-ord5-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/655160652_18069204065639093_5727255413459319301_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_p1080x1080_sh0.08_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=105&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gEIRoiKZlRdmkmbQy1ixQyUE-T5zhX3yF9_1xWW3HD9Uzz0fNAfWOSn9hRTfiQBEEM&_nc_ohc=iuWqEVVv8NkQ7kNvwEC8_FT&_nc_gid=B1m6D_AQERgBrjDM8Shsvw&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&ig_cache_key=MzQxMDU4MjIxODE1MjA5Mzc3Mg%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&oh=00_AfxZYvPnXSUpxl94WTljSOZJgpeZXKokRz0