osa, Cilia Flores, aguardando un juicio por narcotr\u251c\u00edfico.\ Seg\u251c\u2551n la agencia de noticias Reuters, el pa\u251c\u00a1s envi\u251c\u2502 113 toneladas de oro a Suiza desde 2013, cuando Maduro asumi\u251c\u2502 su cargo, hasta 2016.\ .\ Suiza congel\u251c\u2502 todos los activos vinculados al l\u251c\u00a1der chavista y a personas de su entorno que se encuentren en su territorio. El", "isVideo": false, "shortCode": "DTOWNsxDNDU", "timestamp": "2026-01-07T21:20:59.000Z", "displayUrl": "https://scontent-lax7-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.71878-15/610768490_771450988567817_4388417207454978917_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-lax7-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=105&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gFkKj90DyFaV63cruk_G0Hu4_7_O20JiPCBIkNVrTbabT2MedZvzaivbJF2jPOyq1I&_nc_ohc=L2lsHwMm1IEQ7kNvwGQKf9L&_nc_gid=3Ko7xoHmrjLRuFCvnTCXeg&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AfyoaaFwPXJqR6TR1P2LAvVfWx9IuRj5sDW8HamRIIx5_Q&oe=69C90FB1&_nc_sid=8b3546", "likesCount": 75, "commentsCount": 12, "videoViewCount": 1364}, {"url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DTC1cJIDHph/", "type": "Video", "caption": "Nicolas Maduro has been captured! Freedom is at the door for all Venezuelans \u00ad\u0192\u00e7\u2557\u00ad\u0192\u00e7\u00ac\u00ad\u0192\u00d6\u00c5 Amen.\ \ The dictatorship of the Venezuelan regime \u00ad\u0192\u00e7\u2557\u00ad\u0192\u00e7\u00ac is falling right now!\ .\ Nicolas Maduro ah sido capturado! La libertad esta a la puerta para todos los venezolanos \u00ad\u0192\u00e7\u2557\u00ad\u0192\u00e7\u00ac\u00ad\u0192\u00d6\u00c5 Amen .\ .\ La dictadura del regimen de Venezuela \u00ad\u0192\u00e7\u2557\u00ad\u0192\u00e7\u00ac esta cayendo en estos momentos! #venezuela #freedom  #lebanon #libertad #unitedstates", "isVideo": false, "shortCode": "DTC1cJIDHph", "timestamp": "2026-01-03T09:59:11.000Z", "displayUrl": "https://scontent-lax3-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.71878-15/609931984_889995493539453_4155735829951236269_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-lax3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=109&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2