wJwzRGi_GCAhE&_nc_ohc=aQbzxuIvJwEQ7kNvwEGGt-g&_nc_gid=8oK-0PIRFA35dDFBJMLaPg&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AfxDy1nAbdDoY8a36wmzeZpWQ3vlZAus-QSUpk821RbD5A&oe=69C93905&_nc_sid=8b3546", "likesCount": 144, "commentsCount": 31, "videoViewCount": 1195}, {"url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/Cy0mrNsoKy-/", "type": "Video", "caption": "Representando a Venezuela #congreso #esso42 #Venezuela\ \ 42nd Congress of the European Society of Surgical Oncology. Florencia - Italia 2023.\ \ Parte del equipo Presentando 2 trabajos de Investigaci\u251c\u2502n.\u00ad\u0192\u00c6\u00bb\ \ @sociedadanticancerosavzla @grupojsoteldo \ \ @tumastologovzla \ @drakeniavivas \ @javiersoteldoc", "isVideo": false, "shortCode": "Cy0mrNsoKy-", "timestamp": "2023-10-25T12:38:22.000Z", "displayUrl": "https://scontent-ord5-3.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.71878-15/504008727_697628192883898_7189792155438710625_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=110&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gFkIZhPgwPAq3Sk9gGUFRhSNZuUelHTBRmVRF4E_c876btZrkruu1wJwzRGi_GCAhE&_nc_ohc=b_m2SRV2XrcQ7kNvwFKK2YR&_nc_gid=8oK-0PIRFA35dDFBJMLaPg&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_Afwwk_-ivKH-h0nIc59dXI03wiPP80GGKuBnRawxZ7r_2g&oe=69C908CA&_nc_sid=8b3546", "likesCount": 46, "commentsCount": 1, "videoViewCount": 426}, {"url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DWCB8eNETSr/", "type": "Video", "caption": "La secreci\u251c\u2502n por el pez\u251c\u2502n es un signo cl\u251c\u00a1nico que siempre debe ser evaluado por un especialista. Cada caso requiere una valoraci\u251c\u2502n individual, considerando las caracter\u251c\u00a1sticas de la secreci\u251c\u2502n y los estudios diagn\u251c\u2502sticos complementarios necesarios para establecer su causa. \u00ad\u0192\u00e6\u00ae\u00ad\u0192\u00c5\u2557\u00d4\u00c7\u00ec\u00d4\u00dc\u00f2\u00b4\u00a9\u00c5\ \ Escuchar a tu cuerpo y acudir oportunamente con un cirujano mast\u251c\u2502logo es fundamental para un diagn\u251c\u2502stico oportuno. \u00ad\u0192\u00ae\u00c0\ \ Agenda tu consulta y recibe una valoraci\u251c\u2502n mastol\u251c\u2502gica especializada. \u00ad\u0192\u00f4\u2593", "isVideo": false, "shortCode": "DWCB8eNETSr", "timestamp": "2026-03-18T16:00:50.000Z", "displayUrl": "https://scontent-ord5-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.71878-15/653468673_1430610325511822_529853244056018792_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=102&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gFkIZhPgwPAq3Sk9gGUFRhSNZuUelHTBRmVRF4E_c876btZrkruu1wJwzRGi_GCAhE&_nc_ohc=KVOJiQzjMMgQ7kNvwFruD5C&_nc_gid=8oK-0PIRFA35dDFBJMLaPg&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AfwPRoOozssin6X1tm04jkxXlFtvdW1d9_WcJUWHV4ckBA&oe=69C91BEB&_nc_sid=8b3546", "likesCount": 29, "commentsCount": 0, "videoViewCount": 158}, {"url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DVwA8FYjkID/", "type": "Video", "caption": "La Dra. Yariana Chac\u251c\u00a1n cuenta con formaci\u251c\u2502n especializada y con experiencia en el abordaje de la patolog\u251c\u00a1a mamaria, brindando una atenci\u251c\u2502n centrada en la salud, el bienestar y la confianza de cada paciente. \u00ad\u0192\u00e6\u00ae\u00ad\u0192\u00c5\u2557\u00d4\u00c7\u00ec\u00d4\u00dc\u00f2\u00b4\u00a9\u00c5\u00ad\u0192\u00ae\u00c0\ \ Priorizar tus controles mamarios puede marcar la diferencia. \u00d4\u00a3\u00bf\ \ Agenda tu consulta y recibe una valoraci\u251c\u2502n especializada. \u00ad\u0192\u00f4\u2593\ \ #mastologia #UmbertoVeronesi #cancerdemama #prevencion", "isVideo": false, "shortCode": "DVwA8FYjkID", "timestamp": "2026-03-11T16:07:05.000Z", "displayUrl": "https://scontent-ord5-3.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/652811736_18094036325009791_3267845919190257585_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_fr_p1080x1080_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=107&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gFkIZhPgwPAq3Sk9gGUFRhSNZuUelHTBRmVRF4E_c876btZrkruu1wJwzRGi_GCAhE&_nc_ohc=4ggeZgTFny8Q7kNvwFw-1nS&_nc_gid=8oK-0PIRFA35dDFBJMLaPg&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AfyKIeg2ETNbd5vXebTBv3EdH72rZuYwDLr7skmdZSmlHQ&oe=69C9082B&_nc_sid=8b3546", "likesCount": 40, "commentsCount": 0, "videoViewCount": 132}, {"url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DVn-3Y9Ds6i/", "type": "Video", "caption": "En el D\u251c\u00a1a Internacional de la Mujer, recordemos algo esencial: cuidar tu salud tambi\u251c\u00aen es una forma de honrar tu vida y tu bienestar. \u00ad\u0192\u00ae\u00c0\ \ Con el paso de los a\u251c\u2592os es importante priorizar la salud mamaria y realizar las evaluaciones adecuadas, ya que estas permiten detectar a tiempo cualquier cambio en la mama, como n\u251c\u2502dulos u otras alteraciones, y actuar de manera oportuna. \u00ad\u0192\u00e6\u00ae\u00ad\u0192\u00c5\u2557\u00d4\u00c7\u00ec\u00d4\u00dc\u00f2\u00b4\u00a9\u00c5\ \ Hoy es un buen momento para ponerte en primer lugar.\ \ Agenda tu evaluaci\u251c\u2502n mamaria con un especialista. \u00ad\u0192\u00f4\u2593", "isVideo": false, "shortCode": "DVn-3Y9Ds6i", "timestamp": "2026-03-08T13:23:47.000Z", "displayUrl": "https://scontent-ord5-3.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/654735972_18094036460009791_1671295948044225028_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_fr_p1080x1080_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=107&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gFkIZhPgwPAq3Sk9gGUFRhSNZuUelHTBRmVRF4E_c876btZrkruu1wJwzRGi_GCAhE&_nc_ohc=zfJ4eefqSQIQ7kNvwHDIphG&_nc_gid=8oK-0PIRFA35dDFBJMLaPg&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AfwLZ7Mw5Bngu5-9V_LI1dh6dEa_PGXGNEZk14TiuubGYA&oe=69C935AA&_nc_sid=8b3546", "likesCount": 58, "commentsCount": 4, "videoViewCount": 257}, {"url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DVTmPmgjpja/", "type": "Video", "caption": "La salud mamaria requiere un abordaje integral y basado en criterios cl\u251c\u00a1nicos. \u00ad\u0192\u00e6\u00ee\u00ad\u0192\u00c5\u2557\ \ Cada estudio tiene una indicaci\u251c\u2502n espec\u251c\u00a1fica, un momento oportuno y un objetivo definido dentro del proceso diagn\u251c\u2502stico. \u00ad\u0192\u00e6\u00ae\u00ad\u0192\u00c5\u2557\u00d4\u00c7\u00ec\u00d4\u00dc\u00f2\u00b4\u00a9\u00c5\ \ Ninguno act\u251c\u2551a de forma aislada; en conjunto permiten una evaluaci\u251c\u2502n completa y una toma de decisiones informada.\ \ La correcta selecci\u251c\u2502n del estudio, en el momento adecuado, es fundamental para una atenci\u251c\u2502n precisa y responsable. \u00ad\u0192\u00ff\u00ee", "isVideo": false, "shortCode": "DVTmPmgjpja", "timestamp": "2026-02-28T15:20:17.000Z", "displayUrl": "https://scontent-ord5-3.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/648664624_18092684447009791_1856676267552923015_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_fr_p1080x1080_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=107&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gFkIZhPgwPAq3Sk9gGUFRhSNZuUelHTBRmVRF4E_c876btZrkruu1wJwzRGi_GCAhE&_nc_ohc=LUVNR0vIdrgQ7kNvwEumOXw&_nc_gid=8oK-0PIRFA35dDFBJMLaPg&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AfwxYqR4QRmf4Qq3eKM8P1vbpi60N4UOP518hbwz777wdw&oe=69C939B1&_nc_sid=8b3546", "likesCount": 32, "commentsCount": 3, "videoViewCount": 150}, {"url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DVOoAHLDkNE/", "type": "Image", "caption": "M\u251c\u00edster Patolog\u251c\u00a1a Mamaria - Umberto Veronesi Academy. \ \ Gracias, Dr. Javier Soteldo @javiersoteldoc por guiarme en esta formaci\u251c\u2502n de \u251c\u00aelite. @grupojsoteldo\ \ Y a la @sociedadanticancerosavzla instituci\u251c\u2502n de vanguardia Venezolana \u00ad\u0192\u00e7\u2557\u00ad\u0192\u00e7\u00ac \ \ 12 a\u251c\u2592os de camino para llegar aqu\u251c\u00a1.\  \ \u252c\u00edMi compromiso con ustedes sigue creciendo! \u00ad\u0192\u00c6\u00f9\ \ #Mastolog\u251c\u00a1a #UmbertoVeronesi #c\u251c\u00edncermama", "isVideo": false, "shortCode": "DVOoAHLDkNE", "timestamp": "2026-02-26T16:52:54.000Z", "displayUrl": "https://scontent-ord5-3.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/637739634_18091986959009791_2031267664728207124_n.webp?stp=dst-jpg_e35_p1080x1080_sh0.08_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=107&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gFkIZhPgwPAq3Sk9gGUFRhSNZuUelHTBRmVRF4E_c876btZrkruu1wJwzRGi_GCAhE&_nc_ohc=kTMFbtTH_6wQ7kNvwH5zW0T&_nc_gid=8oK-0PIRFA35dDFBJMLaPg&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&ig_cache_key=Mzg0MTE4MzQ2MTc1NTczMjgwNA%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&oh=00_AfwzqzDLsZnUSWiqiZ2YLBKaNa_78euXERXEOdNuLuvS5Q&oe=69C926F8&_nc_sid=8b3546", "likesCount": 140, "commentsCount": 28, "videoViewCount": null}, {"url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DVMAdcnjvSA/", "type": "Video", "caption": "Los estudios mamarios especializados permiten al paciente una evaluaci\u251c\u2502n diagn\u251c\u2502stica detallada, orientada a la toma de decisiones cl\u251c\u00a1nicas, facilitan un abordaje preciso y personalizado del cuidado mamario. \u00ad\u0192\u00e6\u00ee\u00ad\u0192\u00c5\u2557\ \ El diagn\u251c\u2502stico inicial comienza con estudios de imagen correctamente indicados e interpretados, como la mamograf\u251c\u00a1a y la ecograf\u251c\u00a1a mamaria. \u00ad\u0192\u00e6\u00ae\u00ad\u0192\u00c5\u2557\u00d4\u00c7\u00ec\u00d4\u00dc\u00f2\u00b4\u00a9\u00c5", "isVideo": false, "shortCode": "DVMAdcnjvSA", "timestamp": "2026-02-25T16:30:04.000Z", "displayUrl": "https://scontent-ord5-3.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/645857337_18092684960009791_2167062225779530372_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_fr_p1080x1080_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=107&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gFkIZhPgwPAq3Sk9gGUFRhSNZuUelHTBRmVRF4E_c876btZrkruu1wJwzRGi_GCAhE&_nc_ohc=z7usLNiCtRYQ7kNvwEr7-5a&_nc_gid=8oK-0PIRFA35dDFBJMLaPg&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AfxBhE9htmAI5ntXNzPG8dpiVFbc9KtkRLdBgFCs922VgA&oe=69C92ECF&_nc_sid=8b3546", "likesCount": 36, "commentsCount": 11, "videoViewCount": 6619}, {"url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DU6no1wDyJw/", "type": "Video", "caption": "\u252c\u2510Sab\u251c\u00a1as que un implante mamario tambi\u251c\u00aen merece revisiones regulares? Para un control mastol\u251c\u2502gico \u251c\u2502ptimo \u00ad\u0192\u00ae\u00c0\ \ Asegurar que todo est\u251c\u00ae en perfecto estado es un acto de amor propio tan importante como la cirug\u251c\u00a1a misma. \u00ad\u0192\u00e6\u00ae\u00ad\u0192\u00c5\u2557\u00d4\u00c7\u00ec\u00d4\u00dc\u00f2\u00b4\u00a9\u00c5\ \ \u252c\u2510Cuando fue tu \u251c\u2551ltimo control? Te leo en comentarios \u00ad\u0192\u00e6\u00e7\u00ad\u0192\u00c5\u2557", "isVideo": false, "shortCode": "DU6no1wDyJw", "timestamp": "2026-02-18T22:26:01.000Z", "displayUrl": "https://scontent-ord5-3.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/641721142_18091689023009791_4052233450491276979_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_fr_p1080x1080_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=107&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gFkIZhPgwPAq3Sk9gGUFRhSNZuUelHTBRmVRF4E_c876btZrkruu1wJwzRGi_GCAhE&_nc_ohc=w8bthIkcsNEQ7kNvwEZQzim&_nc_gid=8oK-0PIRFA35dDFBJMLaPg&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AfyIVZRL2MiMSQcbu5VY99NP_BVZ9AgRv3FolVYLlbsvsQ&oe=69C93857&_nc_sid=8b3546", "likesCount": 34, "commentsCount": 2, "videoViewCount": 196}, {"url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DUn9Fv8DhWw/", "type": "Video", "caption": "\u252c\u2510Los antecedentes familiares te generan preguntas sobre tu riesgo? \u00ad\u0192\u00ba\u00bc\ \ Si hay antecedentes de c\u251c\u00edncer de mama, una evaluaci\u251c\u2502n profesional puede mapear tu riesgo real y explorar todas las opciones disponibles para ti. \u00ad\u0192\u00e6\u00ae\u00ad\u0192\u00c5\u2557\u00d4\u00c7\u00ec\u00d4\u00dc\u00f2\u00b4\u00a9\u00c5\ \ \u00ad\u0192\u00f4\u2593 No convivas con la incertidumbre, agenda tu valoraci\u251c\u2502n.", "isVideo": false, "shortCode": "DUn9Fv8DhWw", "timestamp": "2026-02-11T16:29:12.000Z", "displayUrl": "https://scontent-ord5-3.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/632302283_18090690233009791_5584733922823393538_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_fr_p1080x1080_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=107&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gFkIZhPgwPAq3Sk9gGUFRhSNZuUelHTBRmVRF4E_c876btZrkruu1wJwzRGi_GCAhE&_nc_ohc=zA3RtsN3KM0Q7kNvwHSEu96&_nc_gid=8oK-0PIRFA35dDFBJMLaPg&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AfyBu2hBFDnjEKfm5UgGV6eNmlQCLR0mOP5gjDdowIctxA&oe=69C918DF&_nc_sid=8b3546", "likesCount": 53, "commentsCount": 0, "videoViewCount": 312}, {"url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DUV4j5YDv-j/", "type": "Video", "caption": "Cada consulta es una oportunidad de invertir en tu salud. \u00ad\u0192\u00ae\u00c0\ \ Esas molestias o interrogantes sobre tus mamas son la raz\u251c\u2502n perfecta para priorizar tu salud. \ 