g?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_ht=instagram.fwbw1-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_cat=102&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gFk32ut9wLCZrhfKDwee5K0sUaEYIhieSK7_l1pwAVXH6z0TSipiSQ10Bd9E5DeFJs&_nc_ohc=NBhOwHdNnqQQ7kNvwHnbuu_&_nc_gid=SfslZv0f2cPx2mKqbq6hvA&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AfwvrlUjiDI3LPrieaypuLodgSE5ECZX-9P1C6JOgR8yCQ&oe=69C9172A&_nc_sid=8b3546", "likesCount": 843, "commentsCount": 19, "videoViewCount": 6590}, {"url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DWFe234iP8p/", "type": "Video", "caption": "Feliz cumplea\u251c\u2592os amor de nuestras vidas! Te amamos hasta el infinito y m\u251c\u00eds all\u251c\u00ed. Te nos haces grande y estamos tan orgullosos de ser tus padres \u00ad\u0192\u00bd\u00e1\u00ad\u0192\u00d1\u2502\u00ad\u0192\u00bd\u00e1 \ \ Siempre mi amor @luigi.dance Que Dios te bendiga! Felices  12 a\u251c\u2592os mi so\u251c\u2592ador \u00ad\u0192\u00d1\u2591\u00ad\u0192\u00bd\u00e1\ \ Crece, sue\u251c\u2592a, vive y disfruta cada instante de esta vida. Tus padres siempre estaremos cuidando, apoyando y guiando cada uno de tus pasos. \ \ Eres el amor de nuestras vidas \u00ad\u0192\u00d1\u2502\u00d4\u00a3\u00bf\u00ad\u0192\u00d1\u2502", "isVideo": false, "shortCode": "DWFe234iP8p", "timestamp": "2026-03-20T00:14:11.000Z", "displayUrl": "https://instagram.fwbw1-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/655064746_18112879400298938_101949876735408504_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_p1080x1080_sh0.08_tt6&_nc_ht=instagram.fwbw1-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_cat=102&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gFk32ut9wLCZrhfKDwee5K0sUaEYIhieSK7_l1pwAVXH6z0TSipiSQ10Bd9E5DeFJs&_nc_ohc=8o0vr0ibzZMQ7kNvwEcBSKg&_nc_gid=SfslZv0f2cPx2mKqbq6hvA&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_Afz9UhdNZONzJm5sHjLLkbzBvSZQRO-_QDipu63GEakbpw&oe=69C93501&_nc_sid=8b3546", "likesCount": 73, "commentsCount": 30, "videoViewCount": 400}, {"url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DWCa4C6Cnyf/", "type": "Video", "caption": "I love it! \u00ad\u0192\u00ff\u00ec\u00ad\u0192\u00d1\u2591\ \ \u00ad\u0192\u00f2\u2551 @luigi.dance \ Coreo:  @zumbabeto @heejiseo__rony @dahriowonder \ \u00ad\u0192\u00c4\u00d6\u