gram.com/p/DV8__e8iH1s/", "type": "Video", "caption": "\u00ad\u0192\u00ff\u00ec Orgullo #venezolano Arpa que soy de Gu\u251c\u00edrico. \ \ Es de #llaneros decir: \ \ \u00ad\u0192\u00e6\u00eb\u00ad\u0192\u00c5\u00a2 El hombre de buena fe anda pa\u00d4\u00c7\u00d6 lante y sin miedo. \ \u00ad\u0192\u00e6\u00eb\u00ad\u0192\u00c5\u00a2 No sirve pa\u00d4\u00c7\u00d6 caporal quien no ha sido becerrero. \ \ Les presento nuestra m\u251c\u2551sica llanera  en la voz de @samueldavidmiranda \u00ad\u0192\u00c4\u00d6\u00b4\u00a9\u00c5\u00ad\u0192\u00ac\u00eb\ \ #musicallanera #venezuela", "isVideo": false, "shortCode": "DV8__e8iH1s", "timestamp": "2026-03-16T17:14:10.000Z", "displayUrl": "https://instagram.fwbw1-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/652614435_18112457327298938_3031834984600236678_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_ht=instagram.fwbw1-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_cat=102&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gFk32ut9wLCZrhfKDwee5K0sUaEYIhieSK7_l1pwAVXH6z0TSipiSQ10Bd9E5DeFJs&_nc_ohc=FqTm1oAcPP8Q7kNvwGeH-yZ&_nc_gid=SfslZv0f2cPx2mKqbq6hvA&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AfyhFXCI_0Go-Bnbp-EMy7VIBRMcmMHMs9OW7xuKqZ3ksg&oe=69C90669&_nc_sid=8b3546", "likesCount": 20, "commentsCount": 4, "videoViewCount": 122}, {"url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DV8dhjWiEPy/", "type": "Video", "caption": "\u00ad\u0192\u00c5\u00d8\u00b4\u00a9\u00c5 Juro no pido m\u251c\u00eds nada \u00ad\u0192\u00ff\u00e8 yo vivo #contento \ \ \u00ad\u0192\u00c6\u00e2\u00ad\u0192\u00f2\u2551\u00ad\u0192\u00c5\u00a5 @luigi.dance @lisbel.lisbel \u00ad\u0192\u00bd\u00e1\ Coreo: @gxvna_ @sahel_vera #zin119\ \u00ad\u0192\u00c4\u00d6\u00b4\u00a9\u00c5 @gentedezona \ @zumba @zincommunity \ \ Gracias @patriciachiquiar por la invitaci\u251c\u2502n \ \ #zumba #zumbatenerife #zumbafam", "isVideo": false, "shortCode": "DV8dhjWiEPy", "timestamp": "2026-03-16T12:09:13.000Z", "displayUrl": "https://instagram.fwbw1-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.71878-15/654012705_692106020614037_4417847615625283375_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_ht=instagram.fwbw1-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_cat=105&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gFk32ut9wLCZrhfKDwee5K0sUaEYIhieSK7_l1pwAVXH6z0TSipiSQ10Bd9E5DeFJs&_nc_ohc=DzFoYsHDHPcQ7kNvwH_X-GR&_nc_gid=SfslZv0f2cPx2mKqbq6hvA&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_Afw_cr72gHyKjhraRuDZoLEJ-8uOf21qaNB_vRtF67r4SQ&oe=69C931B2&_nc_sid=8b3546", "likesCount": 117, "commentsCount": 18, "videoViewCount": 585}]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 'new');
INSERT INTO public.leads VALUES ('7d689220-2906-4131-9d47-f5005e07294f', '5cd06e6e-a6db-4d43-b82b-cd27ee8d1d13', 'a87af457-b15b-40a7-bf8a-cba231bd888d', 'ing.virygaytan', 'Viry Gaytan', 'Creer es Crear \u00ad\u0192\u00e6\u00e6 \u00ad\u0192\u00ba\u2510 Ingeniera en Gestio\u2560\u00fcn Empresarial \u00ad\u0192\u00e6\u00ae\u00ad\u0192\u00c5\u255d\u00d4\u00c7\u00ec\u00ad\u0192\u00c6\u2557 Viajera de \u00d4\u00d8\u00f1\u00b4\u00a9\u00c5\u00ad\u0192\u00ee\u00c4 CEO de @viryaromas', 'Creer es Crear. Ingeniera en Gestion Empresarial. Viajera. CEO de @viryaromas', 'https://virygaytan.scentsy.com.mx/', NULL, 523, 875, false, 'https://scontent-iad6-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-19/587799968_18545490883008882_762385245922013301_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e0_s150x150_tt6&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLmRqYW5nby43MjAuYzIifQ&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=106&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gG_fCYcMhbxYoBPneuf9A5gAOcjwXuJ-THeAoYB-lYPkvPNQJ_e80-MsnEdyRn-nwY&_nc_ohc=s6uWvzMZNvAQ7kNvwHl0TFY&_nc_gid=nf-PhXwMPzFhvHWW9J9VRA&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_Afwre4FOoDQB_OOe-JnoNAHB7y4tOB567atZMBDxHgE5yg&oe=69C93956&_nc_sid=8b3546', 72, 'Es CEO de su propia marca de aromas con website activo, t\u251c\u00a1tulo profesional en Gesti\u251c\u2502n Empresarial y perfil p\u251c\u2551blico. Tiene potencial claro para automatizaci\u251c\u2502n B2B y lead generation.', 'ecommerce', NULL, NULL, 'Hola Viry, manejar un negocio de e-commerce como Viry Aromas y al mismo tiempo construir tu marca personal requiere mucha energ\u251c\u00a1a. Muchas tiendas en tu posici\u251c\u2502n pierden ventas porque no tienen un sistema que siga a los prospectos de forma autom\u251c\u00edtica. Nosotros ayudamos a negocios como el tuyo a generar clientes potenciales de manera automatizada usando mensajes de Instagram con inteligencia artificial. Te parece si te cuento un poco m\u251c\u00eds sobre c\u251c\u2502mo funciona?', 'Hola Viry, me llam\u251c\u2502 la atenci\u251c\u2502n tu perfil porque combinas formaci\u251c\u2502n en gesti\u251c\u2502n empresarial con un negocio propio de e-commerce, eso dice mucho de c\u251c\u2502mo piensas los negocios. El reto que veo en marcas como Viry Aromas es convertir seguidores en compradores sin tener que estar presente todo el tiempo. Tenemos un sistema que automatiza esa conversaci\u251c\u2502n inicial por Instagram usando IA. Ser\u251c\u00a1a \u251c\u2551til para ti algo as\u251c\u00a1?', 'dm_ready', false, '2026-03-25 02:57:05.741592+00', '2026-03-25 02:57:20.429392+00', '2026-03-25 02:57:52.274427+00', '2026-03-25 02:58:20.082981+00', NULL, '2026-03-25 02:57:05.677068+00', '2026-03-25 02:57:52.784786+00', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'pending', 0, NULL, NULL, 'null', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 'new');
INSERT INTO public.leads VALUES ('ebd0f63d-bcd6-4ff0-b02e-e221e5a00cc3', '5cd06e6e-a6db-4d43-b82b-cd27ee8d1d13', 'a87af457-b15b-40a7-bf8a-cba231bd888d', 'tatigarciamedina', 'Tatiana Garcia Medina', 'Abogada litigante - Especialista en derecho empresarial. CEO @garciamaderoabogados', 'Abogada litigante - Especialista en derecho empresarial. CEO @garciamaderoabogados', 'http://www.garciamaderoabogados.com/', NULL, 799, 2260, false, 'https://scontent-ord5-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-19/552208250_18402334246140829_3307858682602631674_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e0_s150x150_tt6&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLmRqYW5nby4xMDgwLmMyIn0&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=101&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gGJrUMZPRCXHAv1Tv7lIfF-4E3qeUJ03vBqNKbr7Ocx-W7X6QpPuomVgPBhkSkmoXI&_nc_ohc=xEPXf_qCcJUQ7kNvwHDFCZ1&_nc_gid=GaM_Q4UGn0f5X1cHRPRCfQ&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AfwVv5ceA3-2uLn-njnXNGfuFZMzGJ0W1eqWpck3yS1E8w&oe=69C93311&_nc_sid=8b3546', 75, 'Abogada litigante especialista en derecho empresarial y CEO de @garciamaderoabogados con website propio. Perfil profesional B2B muy claro con alto potencial para lead generation.', 'local_business', NULL, NULL, 'Hola Tatiana, liderar un despacho especializado en derecho empresarial y al mismo tiempo posicionarte como referente en redes es una combinaci\u251c\u2502n que pocos abogados logran. El punto que suele ser m\u251c\u00eds dif\u251c\u00a1cil en esa etapa es conseguir clientes nuevos de forma constante sin que dependa de referidos o de tu presencia activa. Ayudamos a negocios de servicios profesionales a automatizar esa captaci\u251c\u2502n usando IA a trav\u251c\u00aes de mensajes de Instagram. Te parece interesante explorar c\u251c\u2502mo funcionar\u251c\u00a1a para Garcia Madero?', 'Hola Tatiana, especializarse en derecho empresarial siendo litigante y CEO al mismo tiempo requiere tener muy bien organizado el tiempo. Muchos despachos en crecimiento pierden oportunidades porque el seguimiento a prospectos es lento o inconsistente. Nosotros implementamos sistemas de mensajes automatizados en Instagram con inteligencia artificial para que los leads lleguen y sean atendidos sin que t\u251c\u2551 tengas que estar encima. Ser\u251c\u00a1a algo relevante para el despacho en este momento?', 'dm_ready', false, '2026-03-25 02:57:05.736072+00', '2026-03-25 02:57:51.205011+00', '2026-03-25 02:57:52.401748+00', '2026-03-25 02:58:20.083202+00', NULL, '2026-03-25 02:57:05.677068+00', '2026-03-25 02:57:52.784786+00', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'pending', 0, NULL, NULL, 'null', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 'new');
INSERT INTO public.leads VALUES ('682239b0-7138-47a0-9e79-048a87b2c312', '5cd06e6e-a6db-4d43-b82b-cd27ee8d1d13', 'a87af457-b15b-40a7-bf8a-cba231bd888d', 'jess_y_belle', 'Jess Portillo', 'Closing deals &\u00ad\u0192\u00e6\u00e1a Jeremiah 29:11 @portillodocprep #Divorce #Custody NV \u00ad\u0192\u00d6\u00c5\u00ad\u0192\u00c5\u2557 \u00ad\u0192\u00e6\u00c2\u00ad\u0192\u00e6\u00ba\u00ad\u0192\u00c5\u2557\u00ad\u0192\u00e7\u00a9\u00ad\u0192\u00e7\u2557 founder of @the_womens_executive_circle', 'Closing deals & Jeremiah 29:11 @portillodocprep #Divorce #Custody NV founder of @the_womens_executive_circle', 'http://portillodocprep.com', NULL, 4084, 2050, false, 'https://scontent-lax3-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.2885-19/505432442_18517163533003272_7189426344260536380_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e0_s150x150_tt6&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLmRqYW5nby45NjAuYzIifQ&_nc_ht=scontent-lax3-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=100&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gFM13xRFvXQnN5H-YJ4jJRR1CFHoUvpGcYiVbUqEjEMnJ_jmqMK05MAIU8F7Oipc8c&_nc_ohc=DXO5WqrtTQQQ7kNvwHANiMi&_nc_gid=Hc8f45D7Ml8LcQ8rI9LoMA&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AfyIAZq6Wr2lM-O6fGQbJlP_ePBpG1RXDUcVZJzvRP2KQA&oe=69C91F2C&_nc_sid=8b3546', 78, 'Fundadora de @the_womens_executive_circle con negocio de preparaci\u251c\u2502n de documentos legales (portillodocprep.com), orientada a deals y emprendimiento. Excelente candidata para lead generation B2B.', 'local_business', NULL, NULL, 'Hey Jess, founding the Women''s Executive Circle while running a doc prep business at the same time is no small thing. I imagine getting consistent leads for Portillo Doc Prep takes a lot of your personal time and energy. We help businesses like yours bring in leads automatically through Instagram DMs using AI, so you can focus on closing instead of prospecting. Would that be something worth exploring for you?', 'Hey Jess, the work you''re doing with divorce and custody doc prep in Nevada fills a real gap for people going through tough moments. A lot of local service businesses lose potential clients simply because follow-up is slow or inconsistent. We set up AI-powered DM systems that handle that outreach automatically so leads don''t go cold. Curious if that''s something you''ve thought about for Portillo Doc Prep?', 'dm_ready', false, '2026-03-25 02:57:05.72747+00', '2026-03-25 02:57:51.203898+00', '2026-03-25 02:57:52.283525+00', '2026-03-25 02:58:20.08274+00', NULL, '2026-03-25 02:57:05.677068+00', '2026-03-25 03:25:36.811421+00', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'pending', 0, NULL, NULL, '[{"url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DPxeJFCkXq6/", "type": "Image", "caption": "My name is Jessica Portillo, CEO and Founder of Portillo Doc Prep.\ I had the honor of participating in the She Means Business 2025 campaign, alongside an incredible group of women entrepreneurs who shared their powerful stories of perseverance, leadership, and purpose in the She Means Business book.\ \ After months of dedication, I\u00d4\u00c7\u00d6m proud to share this photo \u00d4\u00c7\u00f6 a symbol of recognition that represents so much more than a moment. It reflects the passion, hard work, and impact behind my mission.\ \ At ", "isVideo": false, "shortCode": "DPxeJFCkXq6", "timestamp": "2025-10-14T02:31:47.000Z", "displayUrl": "https://scontent-lax3-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/565833334_18539383801003272_4548513068120048081_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_p1080x1080_sh0.08_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-lax3-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=100&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gFM13xRFvXQnN5H-YJ4jJRR1CFHoUvpGcYiVbUqEjEMnJ_jmqMK05MAIU8F7Oipc8c&_nc_ohc=FMfXqxAskDYQ7kNvwGL6zSt&_nc_gid=Hc8f45D7Ml8LcQ8rI9LoMA&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&ig_cache_key=Mzc0MjkwNTMzMDYwNDAxNDI2Ng%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&oh=00_AfyhzUIVUUFkNx7Jb4tntc0M44c49xSdT6nwzoMQOkMfgQ&oe=69C91C3D&_nc_sid=8b3546", "likesCount": 194, "commentsCount": 40, "videoViewCount": null}, {"url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DIXoGApNR_g/", "type": "Video", "caption": "Photo dump because life goes this fast!!! \u00d4\u00d8\u00f1\u00b4\u00a9\u00c5\u00ad\u0192\u00bd\u00c2\u00ad\u0192\u00c5\u2557 #quickclips", "isVideo": false, "shortCode": "DIXoGApNR_g", "timestamp": "2025-04-13T02:00:07.000Z", "displayUrl": "https://scontent-lax3-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.2885-15/491440813_18504441049003272_8031302973821006915_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_p1080x1080_sh0.08_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-lax3-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=100&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gFM13xRFvXQnN5H-YJ4jJRR1CFHoUvpGcYiVbUqEjEMnJ_jmqMK05MAIU8F7Oipc8c&_nc_ohc=N6dUt0FRzi0Q7kNvwHbwePg&_nc_gid=Hc8f45D7Ml8LcQ8rI9LoMA&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_Afz_8aB8MThmZDPKYuk9va0g8k2e6QmBjWn8DKmkj3Knjg&oe=69C9249B&_nc_sid=8b3546", "likesCount": 88, "commentsCount": 1, "videoViewCount": 165}, {"url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DVy6juFEmnj/", "type": "Sidecar", "caption": "We\u00d4\u00c7\u00d6re excited to welcome a community partner helping bring strong leaders into the room.\ \ @the_womens_executive_circle is a growing network of women in business focused on leadership, collaboration, and meaningful connections in Las Vegas.\ \ Some of their members will be joining us for The Infinite Exchange on April 8.\ \ As a thank you to their community, we\u00d4\u00c7\u00d6ve created a private code for their members.\ \ Use code EXECWOMEN20 for $20 off admission.\ \ Not everyone belongs in the room.\ Builders recogni", "isVideo": false, "shortCode": "DVy6juFEmnj", "timestamp": "2026-03-12T19:07:41.000Z", "displayUrl": "https://scontent-lax3-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/651060831_17850538617688986_7509788082083427234_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-lax3-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=106&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gFM13xRFvXQnN5H-YJ4jJRR1CFHoUvpGcYiVbUqEjEMnJ_jmqMK05MAIU8F7Oipc8c&_nc_ohc=hXNoJnnQKwEQ7kNvwGCxX1S&_nc_gid=Hc8f45D7Ml8LcQ8rI9LoMA&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&ig_cache_key=Mzg1MTM5NjAyMTE4NDc5NDA0Ng%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&oh=00_AfzwOyzxRQGP2rcBlaODzgjDYGIvXHFF1yZFiP676sonXg&oe=69C9285D&_nc_sid=8b3546", "likesCount": 50, "commentsCount": 2, "videoViewCount": null}, {"url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DVXQ7ZLD_PW/", "type": "Video", "caption": "I shouldn\u00d4\u00c7\u00d6t be here today.\ On Friday, February 27, my whole life changed. I was in a horrible car accident I was rear ended \u00d4\u00c7\u00f6 one that could have ended very differently.\ I don\u00d4\u00c7\u00d6t know how, but I made it through. And for that, I am beyond grateful.\ Today, I am especially grateful for my children. They are my reason, my strength, and my reminder of what truly matters.\ Life is so short. We never truly know when it will be our time. Please cherish your life. Protect your peace. Hold your loved ones c", "isVideo": false, "shortCode": "DVXQ7ZLD_PW", "timestamp": "2026-03-02T01:25:45.000Z", "displayUrl": "https://scontent-lax3-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/640904749_18573570763003272_6398558292703663512_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_p1080x1080_sh0.08_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-lax3-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=100&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gFM13xRFvXQnN5H-YJ4jJRR1CFHoUvpGcYiVbUqEjEMnJ_jmqMK05MAIU8F7Oipc8c&_nc_ohc=QQm7mKdlyaEQ7kNvwHKcoGz&_nc_gid=Hc8f45D7Ml8LcQ8rI9LoMA&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AfzyRJkhkl0PrsppQmzkBRfLHMd2ChC2YdnUd71SrsnqvQ&oe=69C9337B&_nc_sid=8b3546", "likesCount": 149, "commentsCount": 78, "videoViewCount": 835}, {"url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DVAdVAJkYgj/", "type": "Image", "caption": "This year I didn\u00d4\u00c7\u00d6t come with a plan I didn\u00d4\u00c7\u00d6t have to. I have trusted God 100% with the plan that he had for me and it was predestined pre-Determine and executed! I have worked so hard, but I could never sit here and take Credit \u00d4\u00a3\u00bf\u00d4\u00a3\u00bf\u00d4\u00a3\u00bf that wasn\u00d4\u00c7\u00d6t mine. Take an anointing that was gifted to me and I strive every single day to maintain the purpose that was set above before the roles and titles that I have here on earth, I am excited for this next venture in my life. Only the people close to me. Know h", "isVideo": false, "shortCode": "DVAdVAJkYgj", "timestamp": "2026-02-21T04:55:07.000Z", "displayUrl": "https://scontent-lax3-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/639783631_18568525807003272_52261978518919761_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_p1080x1080_sh0.08_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-lax3-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=100&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gFM13xRFvXQnN5H-YJ4jJRR1CFHoUvpGcYiVbUqEjEMnJ_jmqMK05MAIU8F7Oipc8c&_nc_ohc=uv48Akm6JwAQ7kNvwFR4YE-&_nc_gid=Hc8f45D7Ml8LcQ8rI9LoMA&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&ig_cache_key=MzgzNzE5NTg2OTEzODAyODU3OQ%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&oh=00_AfzsYJ66SF_wUneOS3J1-toUKF7P9H9J8TEZCvY_g9WXDg&oe=69C931ED&_nc_sid=8b3546", "likesCount": 97, "commentsCount": 6, "videoViewCount": null}, {"url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DUTqp_xkuej/", "type": "Image", "caption": "I mean, this is totally cute and on point!  It just missed the part of me being a momma. I\u00d4\u00c7\u00d6ll take it. #caricature #chat #igavein  Your turn peeps! \u00d4\u00c7\u00a3Create a caricature of me and my career based on all you know about my life. Go!\u00d4\u00c7\u00d8\ Alright... here\u00d4\u00c7\u00d6s what it came up with", "isVideo": false, "shortCode": "DUTqp_xkuej", "timestamp": "2026-02-03T19:23:42.000Z", "displayUrl": "https://scontent-lax3-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/625362493_18562439359003272_5078843970010941305_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_p1080x1080_sh0.08_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-lax3-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=100&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gFM13xRFvXQnN5H-YJ4jJRR1CFHoUvpGcYiVbUqEjEMnJ_jmqMK05MAIU8F7Oipc8c&_nc_ohc=1AbDjDgNw_sQ7kNvwGqGMXI&_nc_gid=Hc8f45D7Ml8LcQ8rI9LoMA&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&ig_cache_key=MzgyNDU4ODExMjQ5NzE0MTY2Nw%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&oh=00_AfysDxAZjFRTZc4WH2Q-sZDxkWTIfJjqLIM2D8eNldZvsg&oe=69C923B0&_nc_sid=8b3546", "likesCount": 63, "commentsCount": 6, "videoViewCount": null}, {"url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DUH3PGDk5Uu/", "type": "Video", "caption": "My day started lifting 205 lbs off the ground\u00d4\u00c7\u00aa and ended lifting up incredible women \u00ad\u0192\u00c6\u00ac\u00d4\u00a3\u00bf\ \ From deadlifts in the morning to the @womenofnetworking event in the evening, today was all about strength, connection, and community. I\u00d4\u00c7\u00d6m so grateful to have been part of such an amazing event and truly honored to be one of the sponsors.\ \ Meeting so many inspiring women and connecting with small businesses in our community filled my cup in the best way. This is what showing up, supporting each other, and bu", "isVideo": false, "shortCode": "DUH3PGDk5Uu", "timestamp": "2026-01-30T05:50:46.000Z", "displayUrl": "https://scontent-lax3-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.71878-15/625144802_2413539585752143_7195256505098624547_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-lax3-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=107&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gFM13xRFvXQnN5H-YJ4jJRR1CFHoUvpGcYiVbUqEjEMnJ_jmqMK05MAIU8F7Oipc8c&_nc_ohc=xNmaL3YUqCsQ7kNvwEloJR_&_nc_gid=Hc8f45D7Ml8LcQ8rI9LoMA&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AfxSzDvARd10-FH7R97Dj_JLxpr51_vsisAajHEHkIXj2Q&oe=69C90F69&_nc_sid=8b3546", "likesCount": 55, "commentsCount": 9, "videoViewCount": 373}, {"url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DT3YavYkqqA/", "type": "Video", "caption": "It\u00d4\u00c7\u00d6s official we are not Disney peeps! Well it\u00d4\u00c7\u00d6s too early to determine for Avi but I\u00d4\u00c7\u00d6ll def wait another 10 years to come back\u00d4\u00c7\u00aa. #notmyhappyplace #disneynot #1klaterin1day", "isVideo": false, "shortCode": "DT3YavYkqqA", "timestamp": "2026-01-23T19:45:06.000Z", "displayUrl": "https://scontent-lax3-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.71878-15/621575891_935513736315867_4868956442501451530_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-lax3-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=103&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gFM13xRFvXQnN5H-YJ4jJRR1CFHoUvpGcYiVbUqEjEMnJ_jmqMK05MAIU8F7Oipc8c&_nc_ohc=dgSrMq6MLToQ7kNvwFoUuTg&_nc_gid=Hc8f45D7Ml8LcQ8rI9LoMA&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AfxW4fZaukrvBJFKsjtCucEyVJDCTw2G2ASJsTnnDnR1hQ&oe=69C90423&_nc_sid=8b3546", "likesCount": 41, "commentsCount": 2, "videoViewCount": 1459}, {"url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DTrrmMUFBtv/", "type": "Image", "caption": "\u00d4\u00a3\u00bf 2026 Kickoff Networking Night \u00d4\u00a3\u00bf\ Come meet our amazing sponsors, connect with business owners across industries, and enjoy drinks + light bites on PARC HAVEN will be the place to be: January 29 from 6\u00d4\u00c7\u00f49 PM.\ This event is all about real relationships, referrals, and future collaborations \u00d4\u00c7\u00f6 and we\u00d4\u00c7\u00d6re so grateful to everyone who is making this night possible.\ \u00ad\u0192\u00c4\u0192\u00b4\u00a9\u00c5 Limited tickets available\ \u00d4\u00c5\u2502 Pre-sale pricing ends this week\ Grab your ticket now and be part of something powerful. https://bit.ly/4pDlAJ", "isVideo": false, "shortCode": "DTrrmMUFBtv", "timestamp": "2026-01-19T06:39:29.000Z", "displayUrl": "https://scontent-lax3-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/619675135_17858498640595634_7906935810215504100_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_p1080x1080_sh0.08_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-lax3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=102&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gFM13xRFvXQnN5H-YJ4jJRR1CFHoUvpGcYiVbUqEjEMnJ_jmqMK05MAIU8F7Oipc8c&_nc_ohc=ZXLIV5U0yVoQ7kNvwGZJoPw&_nc_gid=Hc8f45D7Ml8LcQ8rI9LoMA&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&ig_cache_key=MzgxMzMzMzI1MDA2MTExNDIyMw%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&oh=00_Afz6nOF8VYk0vvg9HbDADJEmVnXb0a6cfjE3R6HvwwXyww&oe=69C904AA&_nc_sid=8b3546", "likesCount": 87, "commentsCount": 2, "videoViewCount": null}, {"url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DTo_4CWkqsb/", "type": "Image", "caption": "\u00d4\u00d6\u00d1\u00b4\u00a9\u00c5 My girl \ \ #beautiful #beauty #Networking #womeninbusiness #womensupportingwomen #womenentrepreneurs #poshmama", "isVideo": false, "shortCode": "DTo_4CWkqsb", "timestamp": "2026-01-18T05:38:58.000Z", "displayUrl": "https://scontent-lax7-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t39.30808-6/617537228_10229174885466713_705837815161292608_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_p1080x1080_sh0.08_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-lax7-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=105&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gFM13xRFvXQnN5H-YJ4jJRR1CFHoUvpGcYiVbUqEjEMnJ_jmqMK05MAIU8F7Oipc8c&_nc_ohc=uuKvZGSRZY0Q7kNvwEfB9rJ&_nc_gid=Hc8f45D7Ml8LcQ8rI9LoMA&edm=AOQ1c0wAAAAA&ccb=7-5&ig_cache_key=MzgxMjU3ODAxMjMxNjIxNjA5MQ%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&oh=00_AfyZaYgVqrBAspbN2pGrq0vIS-oC0qef