Code": "C5w2SmdLkTg", "timestamp": "2024-04-15T01:12:53.000Z", "displayUrl": "https://scontent-ord5-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/654672949_18077099561420012_7576104339140694675_n.webp?stp=dst-jpg_e15_fr_s1080x1080_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=108&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gHON1k3QdWu9MlJkEofcYi8GwhbSoIevjGuXPJlM5dIK3He-d_QeIdPBdW3aLQLqqY&_nc_ohc=girL1MXwkO8Q7kNvwHSRPTw&_nc_gid=4GAEMriEY9RFYGTlPXajEw&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&ig_cache_key=MzM0NjQxMzI4Nzg1NDAzODY2Ng%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&oh=00_Afy2qZW8pVA_mA4gQynV4fLA6f9XuZZkOGODt-Q5ZID5nw&oe=69C908C7&_nc_sid=8b3546", "likesCount": 242, "commentsCount": 0, "videoViewCount": null}]', NULL, 'Esa simpleza dice m\u251c\u00eds que mil palabras \u00ad\u0192\u00f1\u00ec', 'A veces un solo emoji lo resume todo mejor que cualquier caption largo.', 'pending', NULL, 'CloKXOtrD45', NULL, NULL, 0, 'new');
INSERT INTO public.leads VALUES ('d5237828-8676-4e90-af0c-d54ec43f3704', '5cd06e6e-a6db-4d43-b82b-cd27ee8d1d13', 'a87af457-b15b-40a7-bf8a-cba231bd888d', 'adanssmith', 'Adans Smith | Fitness Travel', '\u00ad\u0192\u00c6\u00ac Fitness Coach | System Engineer   \u00d4\u00a3\u00ea\u00b4\u00a9\u00c5 Travel | Gym | Swim | Dance   \u00ad\u0192\u00f4\u00ae DM for 1:1 coaching & collabs   \u00ad\u0192\u00f4\u00ec Berlin \u00ad\u0192\u00e7\u2557\u00ad\u0192\u00e7\u00ac\u00ad\u0192\u00e7\u00ae\u00ad\u0192\u00e7\u00ac', 'Fitness Coach | System Engineer Travel | Gym | Swim | Dance DM for 1:1 coaching & collabs Berlin', 'http://beacons.ai/adanssmith', 'Digital creator', 24024, 5103, false, 'https://scontent-lax3-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.2885-19/425824519_3393685384256343_4900104398806027045_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e0_s150x150_tt6&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLmRqYW5nby4xMDgwLmMyIn0&_nc_ht=scontent-lax3-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=103&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gFWCJNd0fgQ7Z6DijfJGXQFwP_8I-d-E7gNpXlt94DpQs5yFs9pV12fm3mWeF_v_RQ&_nc_ohc=iwSRGIrcV10Q7kNvwFOwDku&_nc_gid=LNi8dN2LbQLGuUyft4KDTw&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AfxAp8vXLsq0DTZNP6BFUgM1CwP20yAd0z4kLNpvNplZnw&oe=69C93A60&_nc_sid=8b3546', 72, 'Fitness Coach con 24K seguidores, ofrece coaching 1:1 y colaboraciones, tiene website propio (beacons). Perfil claramente orientado a servicios con alta potencialidad de beneficiarse de lead generation B2B.', 'coach', NULL, NULL, 'Hey Adans, combining fitness coaching with a travel lifestyle and still building a personal brand out of Berlin is a solid setup. The tricky part for coaches offering 1-on-1 services is usually keeping a steady flow of new clients without spending hours in the DMs yourself. We build AI-powered Instagram DM systems that handle lead generation automatically so coaches can focus on actually coaching. Would that be useful for where you are right now?', 'Hey Adans, the way you position yourself across fitness, travel, and coaching makes your profile stand out in a pretty crowded space. One thing a lot of coaches tell us is that finding new 1-on-1 clients consistently is the hardest part of the business. We automate that side of things using AI through Instagram DMs so the pipeline keeps moving without you having to manage it manually. Is that something you''d want to know more about?', 'dm_ready', false, '2026-03-25 02:57:05.72026+00', '2026-03-25 02:57:51.202846+00', '2026-03-25 02:57:52.472153+00', '2026-03-25 02:58:20.083134+00', NULL, '2026-03-25 02:57:05.677068+00', '2026-03-25 03:25:36.811421+00', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'pending', 0, NULL, NULL, '[{"url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DQL7KIcjJUP/", "type": "Video", "caption": "If you told me a year ago that this is how I would be able to perform in a year I would have probably said \u00d4\u00c7\u00a3YEAH\u00d4\u00c7\u00d8 because I believe I can do anything.\ \ However achieving it still feels surprisingly good and moving \u00d4\u00a3\u00bf\ \ Learning commercial dance has been one of the most gratifying experiences I\u00d4\u00c7\u00d6ve ever had, thanks @nate_xander and @dsdanceschool \u00ad\u0192\u00f1\u00ec\u00d4\u00a3\u00bf I can\u00d4\u00c7\u00d6t wait to see how I\u00d4\u00c7\u00d6ll be able to dance in a year from now \u00ad\u0192\u00ff\u00d8\ \ Believe in yourself, put the work, do that extra mile and goals start to be achieved", "isVideo": false, "shortCode": "DQL7KIcjJUP", "timestamp": "2025-10-24T09:12:43.000Z", "displayUrl": "https://scontent-lax3-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/571546699_18533240518025259_184280576878395941_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_p1080x1080_sh0.08_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-lax3-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=103&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gFWCJNd0fgQ7Z6DijfJGXQFwP_8I-d-E7gNpXlt94DpQs5yFs9pV12fm3mWeF_v_RQ&_nc_ohc=DZG3cV3_POUQ7kNvwHtcVUS&_nc_gid=LNi8dN2LbQLGuUyft4KDTw&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_Afxa7EMgqL7vL2iVC6RzSMGfZkGCObVMelZzY_Ho8UCkjA&oe=69C90FB8&_nc_sid=8b3546", "likesCount": 279, "commentsCount": 23, "videoViewCount": 2597}, {"url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DMiDuCDs82y/", "type": "Sidecar", "caption": "Post-Gym Update \u00ad\u0192\u00c5\u00ef\u00ad\u0192\u00c5\u2557\u00d4\u00c7\u00ec\u00d4\u00d6\u00e9\u00b4\u00a9\u00c5\u00ad\u0192\u00c6\u00d1\ \ I\u00d4\u00c7\u00d6ve officially reached a new level in confidence, in strength, and in mindset. \u00ad\u0192\u00f1\u00ec\ Right now, I genuinely feel the healthiest, strongest, and most grounded I\u00d4\u00c7\u00d6ve ever felt.\ \ And honestly? I just wish everyone could experience what I\u00d4\u00c7\u00d6m feeling.\ Because when you start truly loving yourself like, really loving yourself and you\u00d4\u00c7\u00d6re surrounded by people who reflect that love back unconditionally\u00d4\u00c7\u00aa life becomes that dream version of itself you always hoped for.\ I\u00d4\u00c7\u00d6m so deeply thankf", "isVideo": false, "shortCode": "DMiDuCDs82y", "timestamp": "2025-07-25T13:18:06.000Z", "displayUrl": "https://scontent-lax3-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/523460551_18514549972025259_5398179756011132573_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_p1080x1080_sh0.08_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-lax3-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=103&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gFWCJNd0fgQ7Z6DijfJGXQFwP_8I-d-E7gNpXlt94DpQs5yFs9pV12fm3mWeF_v_RQ&_nc_ohc=xfhwKgQJRuAQ7kNvwFgQMfj&_nc_gid=LNi8dN2LbQLGuUyft4KDTw&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&ig_cache_key=MzY4NDUyMzc5NjkxNjc5NTk1Ng%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&oh=00_Afz88rvX9ual3VP6_Zv2onyV63QiqPyHZwjH-CJ_wjloig&oe=69C918D2&_nc_sid=8b3546", "likesCount": 4272, "commentsCount": 91, "videoViewCount": null}, {"url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DFLjy5-s0oM/", "type": "Sidecar", "caption": "Sometimes the simplest systems, like just existing, are the most efficient. \ \ Visited this serene little island in Thailand\u00d4\u00c7\u00f6crystal-clear waters, a stillness that felt like hitting the reset button on life. Spent time watching some dogs play, and honestly, it was like a masterclass in simplicity.\ \ Take a moment to breath \u00d4\u00a3\u00bf\ \ #travel #thailand #life #happiness", "isVideo": false, "shortCode": "DFLjy5-s0oM", "timestamp": "2025-01-23T19:56:06.000Z", "displayUrl": "https://scontent-lax3-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.2885-15/474922410_18480120289025259_170002188767477262_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_p1080x1080_sh0.08_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-lax3-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=103&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gFWCJNd0fgQ7Z6DijfJGXQFwP_8I-d-E7gNpXlt94DpQs5yFs9pV12fm3mWeF_v_RQ&_nc_ohc=gcdr4nj_v40Q7kNvwH9fmSn&_nc_gid=LNi8dN2LbQLGuUyft4KDTw&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&ig_cache_key=MzU1MjA5MDE0OTkyOTMyNTQ0MQ%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&oh=00_AfwK7DIrktL9-O5hTz4_NV3DoKzHxYNU6xaH3hNbLVQL3Q&oe=69C91E94&_nc_sid=8b3546", "likesCount": 3031, "commentsCount": 41, "videoViewCount": null}, {"url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DWO2diDIfAp/", "type": "Video", "caption": "Now! That explains my accent \u00ad\u0192\u00bd\u00e1\ \ #thirdculturekid #fitness #travel #happy #worldcitizen", "isVideo": false, "shortCode": "DWO2diDIfAp", "timestamp": "2026-03-23T15:30:00.000Z", "displayUrl": "https://scontent-lax3-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/656005716_18570038776025259_2609388288386231731_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_p1080x1080_sh0.08_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-lax3-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=103&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gFWCJNd0fgQ7Z6DijfJGXQFwP_8I-d-E7gNpXlt94DpQs5yFs9pV12fm3mWeF_v_RQ&_nc_ohc=0uSKQlVQXhMQ7kNvwGT65_l&_nc_gid=LNi8dN2LbQLGuUyft4KDTw&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AfzsrgBNIs21mRFIXnbdsaruRV-cbxzUQc7jdVm9xcNFVA&oe=69C9125D&_nc_sid=8b3546", "likesCount": 166, "commentsCount": 6, "videoViewCount": 1856}, {"url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DWKC68gjOY1/", "type": "Image", "caption": "10\u252c\u2591C and already showing some skin\u00d4\u00c7\u00aa consider it community service \u00ad\u0192\u00ff\u00ee\ \ #menunderwear #fitness #fun #muscle", "isVideo": false, "shortCode": "DWKC68gjOY1", "timestamp": "2026-03-21T18:48:40.000Z", "displayUrl": "https://scontent-lax3-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/656372652_18569164102025259_2999188415118243326_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_p1080x1080_sh0.08_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-lax3-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=103&_nc_o