\ \  Do you guys go sauna after workout?\ \ Did you know that sauna can be very beneficial for your health and muscle growth?\ \ Boosts muscle recovery\ Heat increases blood circulation \u00d4\u00e5\u00c6 more oxygen + nutrients reach your muscles faster.\ \ Reduces muscle soreness (DOMS)\ Sauna helps relax tight muscles and reduces post-workout stiffness.\ \ Stimulates growth hormone (HGH)\ Sauna sessions can temporarily increase human growth hormone, which supports muscle grow", "isVideo": false, "shortCode": "DV_gYWiDORm", "timestamp": "2026-03-17T16:29:04.000Z", "displayUrl": "https://scontent-lax3-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/652827638_18567992887025259_2920695030188244617_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_p1080x1080_sh0.08_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-lax3-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=103&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gFWCJNd0fgQ7Z6DijfJGXQFwP_8I-d-E7gNpXlt94DpQs5yFs9pV12fm3mWeF_v_RQ&_nc_ohc=dA_aY07CFNEQ7kNvwEniSBl&_nc_gid=LNi8dN2LbQLGuUyft4KDTw&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&ig_cache_key=Mzg1NDk0MTQ0MDg1NDIyNDA1Nw%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&oh=00_AfyVcK7cXGagcHyIt6Zt4jNxKu4QDL0Ev_OpBFDt6p7mzg&oe=69C93613&_nc_sid=8b3546", "likesCount": 1057, "commentsCount": 22, "videoViewCount": null}, {"url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DVtbyLcDHbZ/", "type": "Image", "caption": "\u00d4\u00c7\u00a3You\u00d4\u00c7\u00d6re not ugly\u00d4\u00c7\u00aa you\u00d4\u00c7\u00d6re just poor.\u00d4\u00c7\u00d8 \ \ I used to laugh at that joke. But the truth is, the biggest investment you can make isn\u00d4\u00c7\u00d6t money \u00d4\u00c7\u00f6 it\u00d4\u00c7\u00d6s in yourself.\ \ Two years ago I started choosing me.\ \ Therapy. \ Meditation. \ Gym. \ A better diet. \ Dance school learning to express myself, embracing my femininity and sensuality. \ Traveling and seeing the world.\ \ Somewhere along the way I even went blond in Australia\u00d4\u00c7\u00aa because why not fully commit to the glow-up.\ \ But the real transformation didn\u00d4\u00c7\u00d6t happen ou", "isVideo": false, "shortCode": "DVtbyLcDHbZ", "timestamp": "2026-03-10T16:10:17.000Z", "displayUrl": "https://scontent-lax3-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/650404763_18566143936025259_7014564320383667524_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s1080x1080_sh0.08_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-lax3-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=103&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gFWCJNd0fgQ7Z6DijfJGXQFwP_8I-d-E7gNpXlt94DpQs5yFs9pV12fm3mWeF_v_RQ&_nc_ohc=q02cYO5px8AQ7kNvwEHqYpq&_nc_gid=LNi8dN2LbQLGuUyft4KDTw&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&ig_cache_key=Mzg0OTg1NTQ1MTk4MzAxNzY4OQ%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&oh=00_AfyLdNT4SVDLcA2maZVFbiB1-hfLMU-Oun_cn0xPmbLm3g&oe=69C90E8D&_nc_sid=8b3546", "likesCount": 818, "commentsCount": 48, "videoViewCount": null}, {"url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DVoeulfjHGh/", "type": "Sidecar", "caption": "Blonds do have more fun. \u00d4\u00a3\u00bf\ \ #travelgram #fitness #sydney #loveyourself #blond", "isVideo": false, "shortCode": "DVoeulfjHGh", "timestamp": "2026-03-08T17:52:06.000Z", "displayUrl": "https://scontent-lax3-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/649169150_18565689445025259_6100382040435075256_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_p1080x1080_sh0.08_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-lax3-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=103&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gFWCJNd0fgQ7Z6DijfJGXQFwP_8I-d-E7gNpXlt94DpQs5yFs9pV12fm3mWeF_v_RQ&_nc_ohc=lvipodtV-cEQ7kNvwGY6MRp&_nc_gid=LNi8dN2LbQLGuUyft4KDTw&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&ig_cache_key=Mzg0ODQ1OTgzMTg0NjExMTcyNQ%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&oh=00_AfwpSaeuuk4M0Ht_Te4qCGrhH1zVA_BTXzQVPiANcSrxGg&oe=69C93824&_nc_sid=8b3546", "likesCount": 1299, "commentsCount": 25, "videoViewCount": null}, {"url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DVk8ljdE931/", "type": "Video", "caption": "Teaching me that you really can have it all. \ \ In a world where everything moves so fast, you reminded me that life can also be lived slowly, one day at a time, one walk at a time, one sip of coffee at a time.\ \ Thank you for reminding me how wonderful nature is, and how beautiful all the creatures are that we share this world with.\ \ Thank you to your people for showing me so much kindness, warmth, and love. I truly feel grateful for everyone who was part of